    "notes": "Compiles two sessions from three original 10\" LPs (Jay Jay Johnson with Clifford Brown [1953] + The Eminent Jay Jay Johnson Vol. 2 [1954]). Penguin Guide Crown, AllMusic 4.5\u2605. No standalone iTunes entry found for Volume 1; only the Vol. 2 RVG edition appears on Apple Music."
